    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hey! You must be the new technician.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[1]'
      value: '* That''s me. Here to install the AI. = So you''re the one everybody''s been waiting on. No pressure.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[2]'
      value: '* Depends who''s asking. = The quartermaster. I sign your supply forms, so be nice.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[3]'
      value: '* (Just nod.) = Quiet type. You''ll fit right in up here.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[4]'
      value: No badge? Yours is coming later. Supply's always slow.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[5]'
      value: '* Will the doors let me through without one? = Most will, if someone with a badge is close by. Stick with the crew.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[6]'
      value: '* I''ll manage. = That''s the spirit.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[7]'
      value: Oh, before you go. Every suit up here has a little helper built in. Yours won't be switched on yet.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[8]'
      value: Hold your arm out. There. Give it a second to wake up. It'll show you around better than I can.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7689146918282660856, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'greeting.Array.data[9]'
      value: They're waiting on you in the control room. East hallway, then across the maintenance deck.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7866544158687255582, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 33.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7866544158687255582, guid: c3281981306f29f4f888f393fd514059, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.y
